# NormalObjects – Strict Complaint Processor (LangGraph)

A rule-based complaint processing system for the Downside Up Bureau, built with LangGraph.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install langgraph langchain langchain-openai python-dotenv
```

Add your OpenAI API key to `.env`:
## Run

```bash
python normalobjects_langgraph.py
```

## File Structure

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `normalobjects_langgraph.py` | Main LangGraph implementation |
| `lab_summary.md` | LangGraph vs LangChain comparison |
| `.env` | API keys (not committed) |
| `.gitignore` | Ignores .env and .venv |

## Workflow

`intake → validate → investigate → resolve → close`

Invalid complaints are rejected after validation and do not proceed further.